{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"One more test in this class, new on main since the triage: tests/interfaces/store/test_repair_pause_ownership_store.py::test_a_slow_local_git_call_does_not_fail_the_repair_pause (added by ce11e259f8e, 2026-11-19). It writes a shebang git shim into a PATH directory; on Windows the shim never runs, so its call log delayed-update-refs is never written and read_text raises FileNotFoundError (test_repair_pause_ownership_store.py:626). It fails in main dispatch run 44838478830 at 459ad3874dd, sweep (windows) job 136640714807, the only failure there. breezy-hogged-mastiff's change adds its line to posix-shell-stubs.args."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1795229486338994001,"uuid":"d25432d2-944e-47e4-911d-c543431e190c"}